of the .map saving lives in dist/cli, dist/ui, dist/mcp and dist/hooks, which --ignore-scripts excludes by design. HEADROOM IS 7.4 %, NOT 8 %, and the number is stated exactly rather than rounded up to match the pattern: 9.1 over the CI-adjusted 8.475 (local 8.4667 plus the ~8 KB CI delta every prior note here records) is 7.37 %. The 5.903/6.4, 7.238/7.8, 7.805/8.4 and 8.439/9.1 pairs carried ~8 %; this one carries slightly less, which is a real if small increase in flake risk and is why the falsifier below names it. STILL OPEN, quantified for the first time: src/agent-src/ is 94.2 % byte-identical to dist/agent-src/ (284 of 297 files, 2,144,870 of 2,276,707 bytes, content-hash diff). Two prior notes called this 'partial'; it is near-total. It is NOT removable by exclusion — nine shipped scripts under src/scripts/ import through it (build_archive_index, check_estate_count, eval_ui_triviality, explain_run, lint_ui_stack_bundles, skill_usage_report, smoke_quickstart, telemetry_disclosure_hook, utilization_report) while dist/agent-src/ is the tree the installer deploys, so the two copies ship for different reasons. Repointing those imports at dist/ would make source depend on a generated projection, which src/rules/source-of-truth.md exists to prevent. AI council 2026-08-24, 2/2: that needs an ADR covering compiled script entry points and asset resolution, not another files[] experiment. Worth ~102 KB and deliberately not taken here. TRADE-OFF ACCEPTED, named rather than absorbed: excluding dist/**/*.map means published packages carry no source maps, so consumer stack traces show compiled names. GREEN here means 'no regression across the recorded eleven-probe matrix', never 'semantically equivalent'. REVISIT-IF: three clean CI runs measure above 9.1 (the method does not match the gate); or observed run-to-run variance exceeds the 7.4 % margin, making the ratchet noise rather than a floor; or the src/agent-src/ ADR lands and the cap can drop again. NEVER raise it again from a fresh trip without the discriminator the 2026-08-10 note demands. DECIDED BY: AI council 2026-08-24, 2/2 convergent (anthropic/claude-sonnet-4-5 + openai/codex-default, 2 rounds, blind peer review), on a maintainer delegation of owner-reserved blockers for an autonomous drain run. Both seats independently required the 7.4 % to be stated exactly and the GREEN to be scoped to the probe matrix."
